{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ROM","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"羅馬書","commonName":"羅馬書","title":"羅馬書","order":45,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"50bf9b1ce2008ea219f7dc52ed37c0207386446e1e99fe1fc090811ce936fa2e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ROM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ROM/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":431},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["為事奉上帝而活"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["所以，弟兄姊妹，我憑上帝的憐憫勸你們獻上自己的身體，作聖潔、蒙上帝悅納的活祭。你們理當這樣事奉。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["你們不可追隨這世界的潮流，要隨著思想的不斷更新而改變，這樣就能明辨上帝的旨意，知道什麼是良善、純全、蒙祂悅納的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我憑上帝賜給我的恩典勸告各位，不要自視過高，要照著上帝賜給各人的信心中肯地看待自己。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["就像我們每個身體有許多肢體，各肢體功能不同，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我們雖然人多，但在基督裡組成一個身體，彼此聯結，互為肢體。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我們照所得的恩典各有不同的恩賜。說預言的，要按著信心的程度說預言；"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["服侍的，要專心服侍；教導的，要專心教導；"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["勸勉的，要專心勸勉；施捨的，要慷慨施捨；治理的，要殷勤治理；憐憫的，要甘心憐憫。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["相愛相顧"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["愛必須真誠。要痛恨邪惡，一心向善。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["要彼此相愛如同手足，互相尊重，彼此謙讓。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["要殷勤，不可懶惰，要常常火熱地事奉主。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["盼望中要有喜樂，患難中要堅忍，禱告要恆切。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["聖徒有缺乏，要慷慨幫助；客人來訪，要熱誠款待。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["迫害你們的，要為他們祝福；要祝福，不可咒詛。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["要與喜樂的人同樂，與哀哭的人同哭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["要彼此和睦。不可心高氣傲，反要俯就卑微的人。不可自以為聰明。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["不要以惡報惡，要留心去做眾人看為好的事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["如果可能，總要盡力與人和睦相處。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["親愛的弟兄姊妹，不要私自報復，要交給發烈怒的上帝，因為聖經上說：",{"text":"「主說，『伸冤在我，我必報應。』","poem":1},{"noteId":54},{"text":"」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["相反，",{"text":"「你的仇敵若餓了，就給他吃的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若渴了，就給他喝的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你這樣做是把炭火堆在他頭上。」","poem":1},{"noteId":55}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["你不可被惡所勝，反要以善勝惡。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":54,"caller":"+","text":"申命記32·35。","reference":{"chapter":12,"verse":19}},{"noteId":55,"caller":"+","text":"箴言25·21、22。","reference":{"chapter":12,"verse":20}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ROM/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ROM/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ROM/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}